{{Quote|{{Green|Gross! A Sea Leech!}}}}
The '''Sea Leech''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be caught from fishing in water.

== Spawning ==
The Sea Leech can be caught in any body of water if the player has {{Skl|Fishing|XVI}} or higher. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Sea Leech''' is {{Green|160}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|3.72%|1|26.85|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
